00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.450
Remember our golden rule,

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.000
a thin paint will stick to a thick paint.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.680
So this first layer of paint that we put on the canvas

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:07.000
